{
  "A paper for the crossing? The Call, if you please.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/8f060baccd2c7789.mp3",
    "duration": 3.265958,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Straight down Market, under the great clock. You cannot miss it.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/eb27216ba8b0f4a8.mp3",
    "duration": 4.168875,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Then mind the cars. They give a fellow little room here.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/fc0c3e972805b855.mp3",
    "duration": 3.564417,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "A Call for the crossing, sir?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/2c3723d4a016cfff.mp3",
    "duration": 1.976917,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "A paper to read on the boat?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/cd71218f93c6e7d2.mp3",
    "duration": 1.686667,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Have you bought your paper yet?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/804d7e92617321d8.mp3",
    "duration": 1.749375,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Mind the wind; hold it firmly.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/7fc81da851a8774e.mp3",
    "duration": 2.209958,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Good afternoon. Are you bound for the ferry?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/20bafd582d56ab83.mp3",
    "duration": 2.684458,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "At the ticket office by the corner. Keep your parcels close.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/f1e13798fc3382d0.mp3",
    "duration": 3.730042,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "An exhibit of California products, I am told. Ask the attendant.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/eb7e1b79c2a0435c.mp3",
    "duration": 4.600792,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Is this the way to the Oakland boat?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/8eaaf726183e72a8.mp3",
    "duration": 2.034958,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Keep the parcels together, please.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/9288237200e23491.mp3",
    "duration": 2.38175,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "I shall meet you by the clock.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/bba1e590bc31ac96.mp3",
    "duration": 1.781417,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Where is the exhibit attendant?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/cfda12bdad601ba9.mp3",
    "duration": 1.871458,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Any baggage to carry? A trunk, or perhaps a parcel?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/d10e3170fde5d6e6.mp3",
    "duration": 3.813083,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Then give the wagons a little room, and enjoy your afternoon.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/f41b63082513cc7a.mp3",
    "duration": 3.843042,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "By the great clock ahead. Keep your baggage check safe.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/a65f963e30437413.mp3",
    "duration": 3.578208,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Shall I carry that trunk?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/2d61e5915034f61a.mp3",
    "duration": 1.822625,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Which boat are you taking?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/e37e4721f835c33b.mp3",
    "duration": 1.581208,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Keep your baggage check safe.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/1dd975c8a56e7a31.mp3",
    "duration": 1.952167,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "A little room for the baggage, please.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/2d6a9c8f2712d034.mp3",
    "duration": 2.511,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Good afternoon. Can I direct you somewhere?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/ebb3ce5e270448c8.mp3",
    "duration": 3.009542,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "The coffee house is at the north corner, facing the Ferry.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/48efaeb8dc9b6c25.mp3",
    "duration": 3.424875,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Across the apron, beyond the cars. Fine stonework there.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/93954c6a6772ff5d.mp3",
    "duration": 4.031917,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Will you have it wrapped?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/0ca2e6e0fc410853.mp3",
    "duration": 1.372292,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Your change, sir. Thank you.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/aec702af59319639.mp3",
    "duration": 2.6495,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "A little room on the pavement, please.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/e9b78eacb742c738.mp3",
    "duration": 2.441333,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "A few flowers for someone at home?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/c452c5b331f3a19f.mp3",
    "duration": 2.109792,
    "voice": "Samantha"
  },
  "Thank you kindly. A little color for the table.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/1b631a39ac71c907.mp3",
    "duration": 2.857958,
    "voice": "Samantha"
  },
  "Just beside the corner here, beneath the projecting windows.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/1a2e6c312d01f2fb.mp3",
    "duration": 3.418875,
    "voice": "Samantha"
  },
  "A few flowers to take home?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/7414039ab0014bf9.mp3",
    "duration": 1.865958,
    "voice": "Samantha"
  },
  "Shall I wrap these for the crossing?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/60c0c6f69bda5d4c.mp3",
    "duration": 2.018417,
    "voice": "Samantha"
  },
  "Mind the stems, please.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/e142f74a3863ca9a.mp3",
    "duration": 1.826917,
    "voice": "Samantha"
  },
  "Coffee before your boat? Or a bite of lunch?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/a49a99fa4fd4510d.mp3",
    "duration": 2.962208,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Then take your time. The window looks out on a busy street.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/f7bdd1fa56be4659.mp3",
    "duration": 3.6805,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Across the open apron, to the great clock. Mind the passing cars.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/a0d409b056145dd3.mp3",
    "duration": 4.54275,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Coffee before your boat?": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/4b99d8e5f97e9170.mp3",
    "duration": 1.499333,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "Come in for a bite of lunch.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/7efced1b0c3bac5b.mp3",
    "duration": 1.882667,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  },
  "There is room by the window.": {
    "path": "/historical-sf/voices/515efaf13217a119.mp3",
    "duration": 1.637167,
    "voice": "Daniel"
  }
}
